          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngya mbona akabonero akandi omw'iguru, kahango mara k'okutangaza. Abamalaika mushanju baina ebibundo mushanju eby'enzindo, ebyo nibyo birahwerwaho ekiniga ky'Omukama eky'amani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona ekyazoka oti nyanja y'ekyoo etabangijainyie n'omuliro. Abantu ababaire basingiire ekikaaka n'ekishushani kyakyo n'enamba y'eibara lyakyo bemeleire aha rubaju rw'enyanja y'ekyoo baina enanga za Ruhanga omu mikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahoya oruhoya rwa Musa, omwiru wa Ruhanga, n'oruhoya rwa Kataama bati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyahoire ndeba omw'iguru mbona Rwensinga ekingukire einamu Eihema ly'Obusinge ly'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Rwensinga egyo harugwamu abamalaika mushanju baina ebibundo mushanju, bajwete ekanzu za kitaani nungi nizengelera, bekomire enfufu z'ezahabu omu bifuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bitondwa binai ebilikurora harugwamu kimoi kiha abamalaika mushanju epakuli z'ezahabu zijwire ekiniga kya Ruhanga asingire eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitinwa kya Ruhanga n'obushoborabwe birugwamu omwika, gwijura Rwensinga. Taliho yashoboire kutaaha Rwensinga kuhika orwo ebibundo mushanju by'abamalaika mushanju byahoire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
